sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor C as Customer (phone)
  participant N as n8n
  participant B as Brain · customer desk
  participant K as Knowledge base
  actor S as Staff (Inbox)

  C->>N: "Do you treat kids? My son has a toothache"
  N->>B: message from an unknown number
  B->>B: not a member → the organisation's desk bot
  B->>K: search the documents
  K-->>B: nothing about children
  B-->>N: "I've passed this to our team…"
  N-->>C: reply
  B-)S: 🙋 alert on phone + red badge in Inbox (with a summary)
  C->>N: "hello?"
  N->>B: message
  B-->>N: (stays quiet — a person is on it)
  S->>B: reply typed in the Inbox
  B->>N: send on the same WhatsApp chat
  N-->>C: "Yes — Dr Shah sees children, come at 5 pm"
  S->>B: Hand back to bot
  C->>N: next question
  N->>B: message
  B-->>N: bot answers again (it knows what staff said)
  N-->>C: reply
